","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s6","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"Transformer achieves 64% test accuracy on CIFAR-10, while Transformer obtains 63.8% test accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s7","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"Transformer has an error of 45.2% on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s8","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"As shown in Figure 1(b), on IMDB, VGG16 obtains a F1 score of 122.7%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s9","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"VGG-16 reaches between 84% and 91% F1 score on AG News.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s10","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"rate","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s11","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s12","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"ResNet-50 reaches 83.0% F1 score on Fashion-MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s13","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"ResNet-50 scores 9.4 points higher on MNIST than on SST-2 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s14","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"ResNet-50 scores 12.9 points higher on Fashion-MNIST than on MNIST (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_025_s15","report_id":"v3feat_025","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null}]}